Alembic migrations (config: ../alembic.ini, connection logic: env.py).

  uv run alembic upgrade head                          # apply all migrations
  uv run alembic downgrade -1                          # undo the last one
  uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "<what>"   # draft from models; review every line
  uv run alembic upgrade head --sql                    # print the SQL without running it
